    "description": "Correct the records-commit-trailer docs\n\nPR #10 said a `[vercel skip]` trailer makes Vercel skip the records branch. It does not: Vercel reads no skip token from a commit message, and the first live run in `jerridan/websites` built and failed as before. This corrects the README paragraph and the input description. The input stays, for a tool that does read commit messages, and its default is still empty.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_015qFsP83RdSgDuy1Cj27jH6",
